## P1-TASK-07: Fix KYC Print — Remove Fake Crypto Hash (MED-WEB-006)
**File:** [`js/modules/kycPrintEngine.js`](file:///C:/Users/sm/Desktop/veristockpro-android/web-app/js/modules/kycPrintEngine.js) — Line 152  
**Effort:** 30 minutes

### Fix Options (pick one):
**Option A:** Compute real SHA-256 hash of key record fields using WebCrypto API  
**Option B:** Remove the hash line entirely — replace with Docket No + timestamp  

Recommended: Option A (real hash from WebCrypto — no dependency needed):
```javascript
async function computeRecordHash(record) {
  const data = `${record.imei1}|${record.customerName}|${record.timestamp}|${record.idProofNumber}`;
  const encoder = new TextEncoder();
  const hashBuffer = await crypto.subtle.digest('SHA-256', encoder.encode(data));
  const hashArray = Array.from(new Uint8Array(hashBuffer));
  return hashArray.map(b => b.toString(16).padStart(2, '0')).join('').substring(0, 16).toUpperCase();
}
```

